  {
   "id": 19,
   "type": "text",
   "title": "Rates and what is not here yet",
   "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 44,
    "w": 24,
    "h": 7
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Rates (from the owner's AES Ohio bill, usage 2026-08-22 to 2026-09-22, 213.08 kWh; derived by Claude, not billed per-kWh figures [UNVERIFIED]):**\n- Marginal rate used above: **$0.2094/kWh** = supply $23.13 / 213.08 kWh ($0.1086) + \"other delivery charges\" $21.48 / 213.08 kWh ($0.1008). It assumes \"other delivery charges\" scale with kWh. The $9.75 customer charge does not change with usage and is left out.\n- All-in average: $54.36 / 213.08 kWh = **$0.2551/kWh**. Choose it in the `rate` list at the top for a bill-share view.\n- Supply and delivery rates change; update the `rate` options when a new bill arrives. Taxes or riders not on the pasted lines are not included.\n\n**Not here yet:** the harness PC's own power (its plug is not installed) and a combined PC + server cost, the PC's GPU load, replay-archive size, and Loki logs. The PC's CPU, memory, disk and network come from windows_exporter."
   }
  },
